        <title type="html"><![CDATA[add `Snap a length as a line width`]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44194</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44194"/>
        <updated>2026-05-19T21:50:04.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38193798?u=51a29a96b848dcb858148a9940509bf1d87c682a&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Add high level description of  the <code class="notranslate">Snap a length as a line width</code> rounding method, to the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/length" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">&lt;length&gt;</code> CSS type"</a> page.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">The computed value for <code class="notranslate">border-*-width</code>, <code class="notranslate">column-rule-width</code>, <code class="notranslate">outline-width</code>, <code class="notranslate">outline-offset</code>, <code class="notranslate">-webkit-border-*-width</code>, is specified as <strong>"the absolute length, snapped as a line width"</strong> .<br>
There is no docs explaing what that means, that I can easely link in the computed value description.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">border-*-width</code>, <code class="notranslate">column-rule-width</code>, <code class="notranslate">outline-width</code> snapped as a line width:<br>
<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="638316615" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210">w3c/csswg-drafts#5210</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Computed value untangled from <code class="notranslate">*-style</code> properties value:<br>
<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2784905702" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494/hovercard?comment_id=2675800489&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494#issuecomment-2675800489">w3c/csswg-drafts#11494 (comment)</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">outline-offset</code> snapped as a line width:<br>
<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3491018856" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906">w3c/csswg-drafts#12906</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Definition of "length snapped as a line width":<br>
<a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#snap-as-a-line-width" rel="nofollow">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#snap-as-a-line-width</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44193.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4480621675" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44193/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193">#44193</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Relates <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4413852604" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1069" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/data/pull/1069/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1069">mdn/data#1069</a></p>
]]></content>
